sole trigger-editing surface via onCanvasTriggers → update:triggers → persist() path, which goes through the same server-side @Valid + ownership-scoped PATCH unchanged. (6) Removed/de-exported functions: applyEdgeValue is now module-private (lowercase, not exported); disconnectEdge, buildPatchPayload, modelToGraph, and CanvasGraph are fully removed from the module. No external file in the frontend references any of these symbols. No new SSRF sinks, no hardcoded secrets, no insecure deserialization, no auth/access-control regression introduced by the fix."
